## Third-party copyright

Parts of this repository are copied from the Artemis project
(https://github.com/ls1intum/Artemis), which is distributed under the same MIT
license and carries its own copyright notice, retained here as that license
requires:

    Copyright (c) 2026 TUM Applied Education Technologies

This applies to the seven prompt templates under `prompts/`, to `rubric.md`,
to six files under `evaluation-scripts/`: `analysis.py`, `checks.py`, `logs.py`,
`matrix.py`, `review.py`, and `requirements.txt`, and to eleven files under
`live-run/`: `runner.py`, `artifacts.py`, `utils.py`, `run_evaluation.py`,
`run_evaluation.ipynb`, `status.py`, `logging_config.py`, `config.ini.example`,
`create_exercises.py`, `quiz_questions.py`, and `exercises.json`. The README's
Provenance section names the commits they were taken from and lists every line
that differs.

The remaining files, including `reproduce.py`, `make_figures.py`,
`hypothesis_tests.py`, and all measurement data, were produced for this thesis.
